    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d528">

                <pb facs="0975" n="961" sameAs="frus:frus1944v01/pg961"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.CC/9–1444: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Mr.
                            Myron C. Taylor, Personal Representative of
                        President Roosevelt to Pope Pius
                            XII
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-09-14T19:00:00-04:00">September 14,
                            1944—7 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>32. We feel it is premature to inform the Pope of the trend of discussions and
                    drafting now going on concerning the International Organization. At a later
                    stage I hope to be able to send you some useful background information
                    concerning recent developments which can be given to the Pope.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
